# Day 1 投票で Bob (狐) 処刑 → engine が follow-fox-death trait を発動し、
# Alice (背徳者) を follow_kill で kill。

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave
!Alice=背徳者
!Bob=妖狐
!Carol=人狼
!Dave=村人

# == engine: Night 0 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Alice→Bob
Bob→Alice
Carol→Bob
Dave→Bob

# == engine: Day 1 ==
# vote tally: Bob 3 / Alice 1 → execution=Bob
# chain (follow_kill): Alice died
# == end ==
# == engine: Final ==
# result: werewolf_won
# survivors: Carol, Dave
# == end ==

# @expect-event follow_kill target:Alice
